     1771     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-create-complete     AS LOGICAL   NO-UNDO.
     1772     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-create-on-add       AS LOGICAL   NO-UNDO INIT ?.
     1773     DEFINE VARIABLE group-assign-target     AS LOGICAL   NO-UNDO INIT ?.
