     2079     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-issuer-hdl AS HANDLE    NO-UNDO.
     2080     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-state      AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     2081     CASE p-state:
     2082     END CASE.
     2083     END PROCEDURE.
     2084   PROCEDURE write-to-log :
     2085   define input param p-str as char no-undo.
     2086   do
     2087   on error undo, return error
     2088   :
     2089      message
     2090         p-str
     2091         skip
     2092      view-as alert-box error.
     2093   end.
     2094   END PROCEDURE.
